<title>INDONESIA: Indonesia's Indosat says 1996 net up.</title>
<headline>Indonesia's Indosat says 1996 net up.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>PT Indonesian Satellite Corporation (Indosat) said on Wednesday its 1996 net profit was 523.5 billion rupiah against 463.7 billion rupiah in 1995.</p>
<p>The firm also said its earnings per share in 1996 increased to 505.6 rupiah against 447.8 rupiah in previous year.  </p>
<p>			   Full year to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>		     (in billion rupiah unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		 523.5  vs   463.7</p>
<p>    EPS (in rupiah)	  505.6  vs   447.8</p>
<p>    Operating revenues   1,204.1  vs 1,029.6</p>
<p>    Operating income	 589.9  vs   503.0</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	   707.5  vs   611.8</p>
<p>Note: State-controlled PT Indonesian Satellite Corporation is also listed in New York. The auditing process is still to be completed.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
</text>
